            {
                "entry_id": "ac219544-e047-3f3c-8cad-c09608171bb4",
                "word": "saperlipopette",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5cd0f1a0-2715-32fd-9d4e-fcc2db3ac3a7",
                        "entry_id": "ac219544-e047-3f3c-8cad-c09608171bb4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Marque l’étonnement."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "42d9d810-e0e4-4065-b5e2-cd6a862ae9e8",
                                "sense_id": "5cd0f1a0-2715-32fd-9d4e-fcc2db3ac3a7",
                                "text": "Jamais !… saperlipopette de saperlipopette !… Je suis très bon, c’est connu… mais à la fin des fins… des fins !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a75e54e-e5c1-475c-b239-56a664586c72",
                                "sense_id": "5cd0f1a0-2715-32fd-9d4e-fcc2db3ac3a7",
                                "text": "— Saperlipopette !. - c’était son juron favori. - Saperlipopette ! s’exclama le capitaine, l’œil appliqué au trou, mais oui, elle est jolie !…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cdbe5daf-df49-4fdb-b951-eef8223fa8df",
                                "sense_id": "5cd0f1a0-2715-32fd-9d4e-fcc2db3ac3a7",
                                "text": "Saperlipopette, il vient un vent par cette fenêtre !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "24e99712-04cb-40de-b92b-bf96b183f14e",
                                "sense_id": "5cd0f1a0-2715-32fd-9d4e-fcc2db3ac3a7",
                                "text": "Ah ! saperlipopette, Monsieur, vous me la baillez belle ! Vous dites qu’on ne croit plus à rien ! Mais jamais, à aucune époque, on n’a cru à tant de billevesées, de bourdes, de mensonges, de sottises, d’absurdités qu’aujourd’hui."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3845ba14-a544-4803-b24b-b1a3a87b335f",
                                "sense_id": "5cd0f1a0-2715-32fd-9d4e-fcc2db3ac3a7",
                                "text": "Mais Mme de Crécy, voilà une petite femme qui a l’air intelligente, ah ! saperlipopette, on voit tout de suite qu’elle a l’œil américain, celle-là !"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "65832a03-309f-4dd3-8b56-9de3d6375b70",
                                "sense_id": "5cd0f1a0-2715-32fd-9d4e-fcc2db3ac3a7",
                                "text": "— Saperlipopette ! Saperlipopette !\nLe juron de Rimbaud était venu spontanément à mes lèvres. Puis, les autres se succédèrent.\n— Saperlipotte de saperlipopette !"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e76842e-e7e4-406c-b660-97c610d666b1",
                        "source_entry_id": "ac219544-e047-3f3c-8cad-c09608171bb4",
                        "source_sense_id": "5cd0f1a0-2715-32fd-9d4e-fcc2db3ac3a7",
                        "target_lang_word": "fiddlesticks",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fiddlesticks",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36d58ddd-48df-3a10-ac85-3171099219d7",
                                        "entry_id": "4b660ea5-79a3-38e7-aed8-daddf716c334",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nonsense! Expresses dismissal or disdain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "euphemistic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b721ec22-85d5-43c1-a7ad-351b1a234bfa",
                                                "sense_id": "36d58ddd-48df-3a10-ac85-3171099219d7",
                                                "text": "Fiddlesticks! It's nothing but smoke and mirrors!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "843fe183-9503-4582-9312-29cc7d40e387",
                                                "sense_id": "36d58ddd-48df-3a10-ac85-3171099219d7",
                                                "text": "Golden pleasures! golden fiddlesticks!—What d'ye tell me of your canting stuff?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d3d6bf3-ef19-4745-a38f-edbf5db043b1",
                                                "sense_id": "36d58ddd-48df-3a10-ac85-3171099219d7",
                                                "text": "\"Taken the veil—taken fiddlesticks!\" said the old man, merrily; \"why she lives near Lincoln, is married to a substantial man, the junior partner of one of the wealthiest bankers in the county […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c621dc22-fc5e-4521-a391-73d5c606b775",
                                                "sense_id": "36d58ddd-48df-3a10-ac85-3171099219d7",
                                                "text": "'Safe? Fiddlesticks! There is no safe. Mr Lavington is an intelligent man. You will see, he will have devised a hiding-place much more intelligent than a safe. A safe is the first thing everyone looks for.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9254342-1557-4155-b989-b709b45ddbd7",
                                                "sense_id": "36d58ddd-48df-3a10-ac85-3171099219d7",
                                                "text": "“Fiddlesticks,” Miss Jenny said. “The war just gave John a good excuse to get himself killed. If it hadn’t been that, it would have been some other way that would have been a bother to everybody around.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8da6db3-2440-385a-a432-074a1b4bd647",
                                        "entry_id": "4b660ea5-79a3-38e7-aed8-daddf716c334",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Darn! Expresses mild dismay or annoyance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "euphemistic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51c92d6d-568f-4387-b25c-f427dd1bbdb9",
                                                "sense_id": "a8da6db3-2440-385a-a432-074a1b4bd647",
                                                "text": "Oh, fiddlesticks! I locked my keys in the car."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
